{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for griffin-persona-helper's allow-lists. The GUI (griffin_persona/catalog.py) and the privileged helper both load this exact file. Once installed by the .deb it lives under /usr/lib (root:root, mode 0644) so an unprivileged, even compromised, GUI process cannot modify it -- the helper's trust does not depend on where the file lives, only on its filesystem permissions.",
